</span></p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-22044a06"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-9b43c43f">Freestyle Fencing:<br></span></h3><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-31d805cd"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-8ccf31d8">Freestyle Fencing is a unique lightweight, but durable fabric that is digitally dye sublimated in limitless bright and vivid colors.  Ideal for sponsors and full color images. No added cost for additional logos, images, or colors.  Shipping and transporting is a breeze since a roll can be folded up to the size of a large envelope.  Standard size roll is 45” x 50 feet, but custom sizes are available, too.<br></span></p><img sizes="(min-width: 992px) 1200px, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px) 800px, 400px" data-srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-eb803ac6--Screen-Shot-20200609-at-15622-PM.png?v=1591736208 1200w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-eb803ac6--Screen-Shot-20200609-at-15622-PM.png?v=1591736208 800w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-eb803ac6--Screen-Shot-20200609-at-15622-PM_400x158.png?v=1591736208&resized 400w" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" alt="I catcher blade" title="Custom I catcher blade" class="sc-qZtVr dLIPjF pf-16daeb80 pf-img-lazy" data-pf-type="Image2"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-2c00039f"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-80362c00">Event Fencing:<br></span></h3><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-43a016da"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-2f3543a0">Event Fencing is the trusted go-to fence that event professionals have relied on for years.  Large rolls of open mesh subsrate.  Great for extreme conditions.  Screen printed in one or two colors.  Excellent for large events and very budget friendly.  Standard size rolls of 42” x 150 feet.  Available background colors:  White, Black, Red, Kelly, Orange, Burgundy, Royal Blue</span></p><img sizes="(min-width: 992px) 1200px, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px) 800px, 400px" data-srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-21618f9b--Fencing.jpg?v=1586316518 1200w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-21618f9b--Fencing.jpg?v=1586316518 800w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-21618f9b--Fencing.jpg?v=1586316518 400w" srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" alt="I catcher blade" title="Custom I catcher blade" class="sc-qZtVr dLIPjF pf-43c43f57 pf-img-lazy" data-pf-type="Image2"></div></div><div class="sc-pJipy mZVAk pf-029655eb accordion__item" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content.Wrapper"><button type="button" class="sc-pBlxj gYSgcm pf-6f7f3e1e pf-bg-lazy accordion__header pf-anchor" data-header-id="7f3e1e47-394a-4ded-b92d-496a78bf744f" data-action="accordion2" data-preopen="false" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="icon_position accordion__arrow fa fa-chevron-right"></i>Freestyle Fencing Specs</button><div class="sc-qYUWV exYsxy pf-53029655 accordion__content" mode="view" data-id="7f3e1e47-394a-4ded-b92d-496a78bf744f" data-pf-type="Accordion2.Content" style="display: none;"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-qQKeD NKnmf pf-394aaded"><div><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-1e47394a">Product Specs</span></div></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-916f1605"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-57fb916f">Freestyle Fencing Specs:<br></span></h3><ul data-pf-type="List" class="sc-pcLhl bMMcvF pf-e484b0fc" style="--text-indent:0; --line-spacing:10px;"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-oUnPI iVVzrr pf-a5fd4f5f"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-a8d96610">Ultra lightweight airtex fabric mesh 115g</span></li><li data-pf-type="L